note Grep, in the GUI. The search box runs a Rust regex over the lines already in memory - there is no file I/O and no index of its own - and drops the hits into the Results tab, capped at five thousand so a pattern like a single dot cannot freeze the window. The tab itself is drawn by the frame like any other, virtualised so only the visible hits become elements, and clicking one opens that line in the listing. The same regex engine backs the CLI's grep and notes commands.

